  "title": "Cost recovery using supplied assumptions",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Cost recovery using supplied assumptions</h2><p>Prepare a deduction schedule using only the rates and limits explicitly provided for this training case.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m3-tbs2-f1\">Basis after Section 179</label><input id=\"reg-m3-tbs2-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m3-tbs2-f2\">Bonus deduction under the supplied rate</label><input id=\"reg-m3-tbs2-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m3-tbs2-f3\">Ordinary first-year depreciation</label><input id=\"reg-m3-tbs2-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m3-tbs2-f4\">Adjusted basis after all stated deductions</label><input id=\"reg-m3-tbs2-f4\" type=\"text\"></div></section>",
